        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "The nonanuclear complexes [Ln9L16(OX)10](OX) (L = acac or acac-d7; X = H or D) were prepared by adaptation of a literature procedure. Deuteration was varied by using hydrated or deuterated Ln salts, MeOH or CD3OD, and protiated or deuterated acetylacetone. This Yb9 entry is the partially deuterated DLn:Ds:HL congener. The main text states that full synthetic details are in the ESI; no numerical reagent amounts are given in the main article.",
